meta {
  name: Reset
  seq: 3
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  # MTSS > Reset
  
  Deletes everything the MTSS scenarios create, from any state (complete, partial, failed or
  replayed pass), so the next pass starts from scratch. Run Down 1 → Down 13 in order (events and
  associations before the records they reference). Every script is safe to re-run: 204 = deleted,
  404 = not present.
  
  Dependencies (school, students, staff, their associations, descriptors) are kept: scenarios never
  change them, and people can't be deleted with a relationship-based key.
  
  CI runs Reset at the start and at the end of each chain.
}
